:''Cat Cannon recharge speed increased!''
The '''Turbo Machine''' is the 10th [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]. Like the [[Mysterious Force]] with which it stacks, it improves the [[Cat Cannon]]'s recharge speed.

==Effect==
Each Turbo Machine reduces the [[Cat Cannon]]'s recharge time by a maximum of 5 seconds.

When a player has activated Turbo Machine at 100% in all three chapters, the Cat Cannon's recharge time is reduced by 15 seconds.

