==Trivia==
*In the Japanese version, the Turbo Machine's equivalent is the '''Bigness of Hokkaido''' (北海道のデカさ), Hokkaido being the prefecture whose Treasure is required to unlock it.
**In the [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|original English version]], its name was shortened to just '''Bigness'''.
**Its name may be a reference to the fact that Hokaiddo is considered to be the largest Japanese prefecture.
*The Turbo Machine and the [[Mysterious Force]] are the only Treasures to be activated after obtaining 1 Treasure.
